# Modula MCP authority

Full rules: `CLAUDE.md`. Do not duplicate large policy here.

## Authority order

1. Installed versions in this repo (`package.json` / lockfile)
2. Modula architecture + dependency skills under `.cursor/skills/`
3. Expo MCP for Expo/EAS guidance; Context7 for third-party library docs
4. Runtime debug: Metro MCP → Expo local MCP → Mobile MCP → Chrome DevTools / Playwright
5. Figma Console MCP for design context (read-only default); no mass token migration
6. GitHub MCP read-first; never commit PATs

## Scope guardrails

- Prefer docs/config/rules over app refactors for tooling missions
- Preserve uncommitted work and running tunnels (e.g. port 4020)
- Apple Docs/HIG MCP is optional; use apple.com docs unless a team-approved MCP exists
